{"name": "Sanctuary: Shattered Sun", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>This is a pre-alpha demo with bugs in it! It does not run properly on Linux yet!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sanctuary will feature a campaign, multiplayer, base building, a flow-based economy, kingpiece commander units, as well as land, sea and air combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0c8cbc22be340afac2ea19ee0af7ebe1.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0c8cbc22be340afac2ea19ee0af7ebe1.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0c8cbc22be340afac2ea19ee0af7ebe1.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every projectile is simulated. Nukes level bases and energy shield generators hold the line against long-range artillery strikes. Sanctuary has a core focus on strategic decision-making over fast-paced micromanagement.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"34\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ebcb5ea40a9a64da6cfe374680a1e805.webp?t=1784814821\" width=\"433\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When conventional weapons aren't enough, deploy superweapons that literally break the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/eae12260497dbf4ee216b40abb8c9077.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/eae12260497dbf4ee216b40abb8c9077.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/eae12260497dbf4ee216b40abb8c9077.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch as your enemies' bases plummet into the sun below when you destroy the structural supports of the Dyson Sphere itself, crumbling the ground from under them.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"34\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/149f2dde62473ae698907ab8096c5357.webp?t=1784814821\" width=\"375\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seize control of Sanctuary's climate systems to reshape the battlefield.  Watch as your enemies' fleets become trapped in ice while your armies advance across the frozen wastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/659cf907851ac9488ed197ee62cadde8.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/659cf907851ac9488ed197ee62cadde8.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/659cf907851ac9488ed197ee62cadde8.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/1c18c811e46283abab2e2390059f67b9.webp?t=1784814821\" width=\"613\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Few players will muster the enormous resources needed to build a Titan, but even fewer will survive fighting one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/566b4cc4e871cb9862df6b2ff807e8da.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/566b4cc4e871cb9862df6b2ff807e8da.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/566b4cc4e871cb9862df6b2ff807e8da.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"34\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/e5f1ef1458f931fa535a1d1f286cb265.webp?t=1784814821\" width=\"524\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy the enemy commander and you win, but be careful because if your own commander falls ... it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/bb4e29fa4ea543083ee71dac2ed74682.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/bb4e29fa4ea543083ee71dac2ed74682.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/bb4e29fa4ea543083ee71dac2ed74682.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"34\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/abe5e2197bf6c18dee44e5f91715bfba.webp?t=1784814821\" width=\"392\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scale matters: wage war across massive 40km x 40km battlefields with up to 10,000 units under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/99026ff8dfe7d39ba067ae5661d2e836.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/99026ff8dfe7d39ba067ae5661d2e836.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/99026ff8dfe7d39ba067ae5661d2e836.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch as physically simulated projectiles create unexpected moments of warfare - like missiles striking aircraft in mid-flight instead of their intended targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"34\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/7ffa814d9433e3c0aeb2d604ee7602e0.webp?t=1784814821\" width=\"492\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 2758, and humanity's greatest achievement encircles the sun - Sanctuary, a Dyson Sphere housing over a trillion lives. But this marvel of engineering has become a battlefield, its gleaming cities reduced to rubble, its surfaces scarred by endless war. The dreams of paradise have given way to a brutal struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ddc6d4a97e71969c789f9d6789b5af74.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ddc6d4a97e71969c789f9d6789b5af74.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ddc6d4a97e71969c789f9d6789b5af74.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your allegiance among three distinct factions: the pragmatic EDA, the futuristic Chosen, or the enigmatic Guard. Each brings unique strategies, technologies, and units to the fight for control of humanity's greatest creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"34\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/9db4918df993d24674cba6f8162daea1.webp?t=1784814821\" width=\"466\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powered by cutting-edge DOTS technology, Sanctuary: Shattered Sun delivers smooth performance even in the largest battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0b822af807518daf8e3452d19d7d2e96.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0b822af807518daf8e3452d19d7d2e96.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0b822af807518daf8e3452d19d7d2e96.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every explosion, every unit, and every tactical decision comes together in a seamless experience that pushes the boundaries of what's possible in strategy gaming. Watch thousands of units clash without your PC slowing to a crawl. </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Command vast armies across the surface of a star-encompassing Dyson Sphere in this next-gen RTS. Shatter the map itself with superweapons, freeze oceans to create new invasion routes, and control hundreds of units in your quest to dominate humanity's greatest megastructure.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/73efeed529c1b9fad24293ade77285dd167e8fd9/header.jpg?t=1784814821", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Real-Time with Pause", "Strategy", "RTS", "Sci-fi", "Military", "War"], "developers": "Enhearten Media", "publishers": "Enhearten Media", "release_date": "August 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1699050", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "21 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/SzwhcmehpCY", "first_seen": 1784592000.0}